    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33518" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pālo</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a.
		1. palus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to support with pales</i>, <i>stakes</i>, or <i>props; to prop up</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">reliquae partes vinearum nunc palandae et
					alligandae sunt,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					11, 2, 16</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ut vitis paletur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 2, 16 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Pall. 12, 15</span></i>.</div>
